{"id":"b283932d44a857c0","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-feferman-consistent-numeration.md","title":"A Binumeration with Provable Consistency","display":"thm-feferman-consistent-numeration — A Binumeration with Provable Consistency","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-feferman-consistent-numeration","aliases":["67-thm-feferman-consistent-numeration"],"display":"thm-feferman-consistent-numeration — A Binumeration with Provable Consistency","depends_on":["[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-numeration]]","[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","[[67-df-formula-provability]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":2,"source_label":"Theorem 7","source_printed_pages":"29–30","source_pdf_pages":"40–41","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-feferman-consistent-numeration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-feferman-consistent-numeration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-feferman-consistent-numeration — A Binumeration with Provable Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"29–30"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"40–41"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述已与原书逐项核对；已读源证明，未独立形式化其全部算术化细节"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是一致原始递归公理呈示；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为本册固定句法编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)=\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in T\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)=\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in T\\}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(z)\">\\(\\tau(z)\\)</span> 是至多自由变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 的算术公式，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c200c8ec3685766\" href=\"?note=9c200c8ec3685766\" title=\"67-df-numeration\">67-df-numeration</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))\">\\(\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))\\)</span>；不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>任意公式公理谓词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma\\)</span> 及参数化截断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\upharpoonright b\">\\(\\sigma\\upharpoonright b\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"1e05755479add015\" href=\"?note=1e05755479add015\" title=\"67-df-formula-provability\">67-df-formula-provability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau\\upharpoonright z}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau\\upharpoonright z}\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是保留的自由界变量，公理测试变量及证明绑定变量取新鲜改名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^*\">\\(\\tau^*\\)</span> 在下式构造。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的句法编号精确取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_L\">\\(g=c_L\\)</span>（算术语言时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_A\">\\(L=L_A\\)</span>）；数词代入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5fa3acf328238c71\" href=\"?note=5fa3acf328238c71\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions\">67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions</a> 的对应程序，图公式使用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^*(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau(z)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau\\upharpoonright z},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau^*,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau^*}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^*(z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau(z)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau\\upharpoonright z},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau^*,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau^*}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 2.7, pp.29–30（PDF 40–41），公式截断界已目视核对。它说明外延相同的逐数双表示可以产生内部强度不同的一致性句；不能把第二不完全性无条件应用于任意外延正确的公理公式。</p>\n<p>逐数双表示由各有限片段的一致性与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的反身性得到。PA 证明一致性的核心是：若原公理公式不一致，取第一个不一致的代码截断；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^*\">\\(\\tau^*\\)</span> 的所有可用公理就局限于此前一致的片段。若原公理公式一致，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^*\\to\\tau\">\\(\\tau^*\\to\\tau\\)</span> 的包含关系已经足够。原书还说明当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为 PR 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^*\">\\(\\tau^*\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>，不能在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 中等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 公理公式。本条不额外声称已经独立验证原书全部有限片段与反身性基础事实。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","hea