\\sigma$ 及参数化截断 $\\sigma\\upharpoonright b$ 见 [[67-df-formula-provability]]。$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau\\upharpoonright z}$ 中 $z$ 是保留的自由界变量，公理测试变量及证明绑定变量取新鲜改名；$\\tau^*$ 在下式构造。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-strong-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"a329235da6144513","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的句法编号精确取 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_L$（算术语言时 $L=L_A$）；数词代入取 [[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]] 的对应程序，图公式使用同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions","status":"resolved","id":"5fa3acf328238c71","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的句法编号精确取 [[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]] 的 $g=c_L$（算术语言时 $L=L_A$）；数词代入取 [[67-df-arithmetic-syntax-functions]] 的对应程序，图公式使用同一 $\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_g(T)=\\{g(\\varphi):\\varphi\\in T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(z)","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\upharpoonright b","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau\\upharpoonright z}","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^*","display":false},{"tex":"g=c_L","display":false},{"tex":"L=L_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^*(z)&\\coloneqq\\tau(z)\\land\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau\\upharpoonright z},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Binum}_T(\\tau^*,\\mathrm{Code}_g(T))&\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{\\tau^*}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^*\\to\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^*","disp